{"t_ms": 2303781, "conversation_id": "conv_sentence_end_s0_033", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Spa Services\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe Serenity Spa operates daily from 10:00 AM to 9:00 PM. Guests can choose from massages, facials, body treatments, and wellness therapies. Advance appointments are recommended to ensure availability. Guests are advised to arrive at least 15 minutes before their scheduled treatment.", "# corpus/ \u2014 Hotel Documents\n\n**Owner: Lakshya**\n\n## What this folder is\n\nThe hotel's documents live here: the knowledge the assistant answers from. About 60 short \ndocuments covering things like pool and gym hours, check-in and check-out rules, menus, and \npolicies.\n\n## How to fill it\n\nSee the full instructions in `retrieval/README.md` (Step 1). In short:\n- Write ~60 short documents, one topic per file, as `.txt` or `.md`.\n- Make them realistic and varied.\n- Deliberately plant a few contradictions (e.g. one doc says the pool closes at 10 PM, \n  another says 9 PM) and keep a note of which ones, for a later experiment.\n\nThe index-building script reads every file in this folder, so anything you put here becomes \npart of the searchable knowledge.\n", "Yoga & Meditation Sessions\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nComplimentary yoga and meditation sessions are conducted every morning from 6:30 AM to 7:30 AM in the Wellness Studio. Certified instructors guide participants through beginner-friendly exercises focused on relaxation, flexibility, and mindfulness. Prior registration at the Front Desk is recommended due to limited seating."], "scores": [0.6997101306915283, 0.8065493106842041, 0.9491027593612671], "filenames": ["33_spa.txt", "README.md", "39_yoga.txt"], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 400, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
